Description: Provides quality control tools for Oxford Nanopore Technologies (ONT)
    sequencing data. Reads sequencing summary files produced by Guppy or Dorado
    and generates interactive plots and summary tables covering read-length
    distributions, base quality scores, cumulative yield, sequencing throughput,
    translocation speed, and pore channel activity. A single call to
    generate_report() renders a self-contained HTML report from one or more
    summary files, with automatic single-sample or multi-sample layout selection.
